{"id":10408,"date":"2026-03-26T12:01:54","date_gmt":"2026-03-26T12:01:54","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/?p=10408"},"modified":"2026-03-26T12:01:54","modified_gmt":"2026-03-26T12:01:54","slug":"found-a-wasp-nest-in-melbourne-heres-what-you-should-do","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/found-a-wasp-nest-in-melbourne-heres-what-you-should-do\/","title":{"rendered":"Found a Wasp Nest in Melbourne? Here\u2019s What You Should Do"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Finding a wasp nest around your home can be stressful. One moment everything is fine, and the next you notice wasps flying in and out of the same spot. It could be near your roof, garden, garage, or even inside a wall.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you have spotted a <\/span><b>wasp nest Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, it\u2019s important to act quickly\u2014but also carefully.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wasps can become aggressive if disturbed. Trying to handle the situation without proper knowledge can lead to painful stings or even serious reactions.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In this blog, we\u2019ll walk you through what to do, what to avoid, and when it\u2019s best to call professionals.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>How to Identify a Wasp Nest<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10411\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-11.55.14-AM-300x200.jpeg\" alt=\"Wasp Nest Melbourne\" width=\"602\" height=\"401\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-11.55.14-AM-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-11.55.14-AM-768x512.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-11.55.14-AM.jpeg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 602px) 100vw, 602px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Before taking action, you need to be sure it\u2019s actually a wasp nest.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In Melbourne, wasp nests are commonly found in:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Roof corners<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Garden trees or shrubs<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wall cavities<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Outdoor sheds or garages<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Under decks or patios<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A wasp nest usually looks like a paper-like structure. Some are small and hidden, while others grow larger over time.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You may also notice:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Constant wasp activity in one area<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Buzzing sounds near walls or ceilings<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wasps entering small gaps or holes<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you see these signs, chances are you are dealing with a wasp nest.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Stay Calm and Keep Your Distance<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The first and most important step is simple\u2014don\u2019t panic.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Avoid going near the nest. Wasps are very protective of their colony. Even small disturbances can make them aggressive.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Make sure:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Children stay away from the area<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Pets are kept indoors<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No one tries to touch or shake the nest<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Keeping distance reduces the risk of getting stung.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Do Not Try DIY Removal<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Many people think they can remove the nest themselves using sprays or home methods.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is risky.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wasps can attack in groups when they feel threatened. A single mistake can lead to multiple stings.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Common DIY mistakes include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spraying the nest without protection<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trying to knock it down<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Burning or flooding the nest<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These actions can make the situation worse.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Even if the nest looks small, it can still be dangerous.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Understand the Risk of Wasps<\/b><\/h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10410\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-12.06.31-PM-300x200.jpeg\" alt=\"Wasp Nest Melbourne\" width=\"677\" height=\"451\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-12.06.31-PM-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-12.06.31-PM.jpeg 724w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 677px) 100vw, 677px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wasps are not like bees. They can sting multiple times and become aggressive quickly.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Some risks include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Painful stings<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Swelling and irritation<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Allergic reactions<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Serious health issues in rare cases<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If someone in your home is allergic, the situation becomes more serious.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">That\u2019s why handling a <\/span><b>wasp nest Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> situation carefully is very important.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>When Should You Call a Professional?<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In most cases, the safest option is to call a pest control expert.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You should call professionals if:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The nest is large<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It is located inside walls or roofs<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wasp activity is high<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You are unsure how to handle it<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional services have:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Proper safety gear<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Right treatment methods<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Experience in handling wasps<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">They can remove the nest safely without putting you at risk.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Why Professional Wasp Removal Is Better<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10409\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-12.07.25-PM-300x170.jpeg\" alt=\"Wasp Nest Melbourne\" width=\"868\" height=\"492\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-12.07.25-PM-300x170.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-12.07.25-PM-1024x581.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-12.07.25-PM-768x435.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-25-at-12.07.25-PM.jpeg 1030w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 868px) 100vw, 868px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hiring experts is not just about convenience\u2014it\u2019s about safety and effectiveness.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A professional team will:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Inspect the nest properly<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Identify the wasp type<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Use safe and controlled methods<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ensure complete removal<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">They also reduce the chances of wasps returning.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trying to remove a nest yourself may leave parts behind, leading to future problems.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Preventing Wasp Nests in the Future<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Once the nest is removed, it\u2019s important to take steps to avoid it happening again.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here are some simple tips:<\/span><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li><b> Seal Entry Points<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Close gaps in walls, roofs, and windows. Wasps often enter through small openings.<\/span><\/p>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li><b> Keep Outdoor Areas Clean<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Food scraps and sweet items attract wasps. Keep your outdoor space tidy.<\/span><\/p>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li><b> Regular Inspection<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Check your property regularly, especially during warmer months in Melbourne.<\/span><\/p>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li><b> Trim Trees and Bushes<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Overgrown plants provide a perfect place for wasps to build nests.<\/span><\/p>\n<ol start=\"5\">\n<li><b> Dispose of Garbage Properly<\/b><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Keep bins closed and clean to avoid attracting pests.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Common Places Where Wasps Build Nests in Melbourne<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In Melbourne homes, wasps often choose quiet and protected areas.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Roof eaves<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Garage corners<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Garden trees<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Outdoor furniture<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Inside wall cavities<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Knowing these spots can help you detect nests early.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><b>Don\u2019t Ignore the Problem<\/b><\/h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Some people ignore small nests, thinking they will go away on their own.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">But wasp nests grow quickly.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A small nest today can become a big problem in a few weeks.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">More wasps means higher risk.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Taking action early is always the better choice.<\/span><\/p>\n<h5><b>Choose a Trusted Wasp Removal Service in Melbourne<\/b><\/h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you have found a <\/span><b>wasp nest in Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, don\u2019t take unnecessary risks.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is a trusted name in Melbourne for safe and effective pest control solutions. With experienced technicians and the right tools, they specialise in handling wasp infestations quickly and professionally.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It\u2019s always better to rely on trained professionals who can handle the situation safely.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A trusted service like <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> offers:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fast response<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Safe removal methods<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Experienced technicians<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Reliable service across Melbourne<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h6><b>What You Should Do Next<\/b><\/h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Finding a wasp nest can be scary, but the right steps can keep you safe.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Remember:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stay away from the nest<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Avoid DIY methods<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Call professionals when needed<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Handling a <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wasp-removal-melbourne\/\"><b>wasp nest Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> situation the right way protects you, your family, and your property.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Don\u2019t wait until it becomes a bigger problem. Act early and stay safe.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Finding a wasp nest around your home can be stressful. One moment everything is fine, and the next you notice wasps flying in and out of the same spot. It could be near your roof, garden, garage, or even inside a wall. If you have spotted a wasp nest Melbourne, it\u2019s important to act quickly\u2014but [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":10412,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[17],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-10408","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-wasp-nest-removal"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v25.4 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Wasp Nest Melbourne: What To Do If You Find One<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Found a wasp nest in Melbourne? Learn what steps to take, safety tips, and when to call experts for quick and safe wasp removal near you\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/found-a-wasp-nest-in-melbourne-heres-what-you-should-do\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Wasp Nest Melbourne: What To Do If You Find One\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Found a wasp nest in Melbourne? Learn what steps to take, safety tips, and when to call experts for quick and safe wasp removal near you\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/found-a-wasp-nest-in-melbourne-heres-what-you-should-do\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-03-26T12:01:54+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/7-states.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"7 Sta